odifications.", "created_at": "2023-02-24T14:04:21Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d3a06132f1bceedb62c04b470a51ecd1294fd346", "message": "implemented the plnpca model and added the visualization of the list of the ELBO along the iteration to know if we have converged.", "created_at": "2022-06-02T14:05:16Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b9c6c8a0436c0674e8f3f0b37d51ea8d190bdde4", "message": "Implemented the poisson regression and the initialization ofr C and Sigma", "created_at": "2022-06-01T12:56:24Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "918117a8a192638b20e710380c964695279ae096", "message": "put the code that were previously on VEM.r allowing to compare the confidence intervals from the sandwich estimator and the estimation from the importance sampling.", "created_at": "2022-06-01T12:55:19Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0150c54a7f5928e43f7e1ad98ef438192f1bd3f3", "message": "Implemented the initialization for the PLNPCA for Theta and C. Did not initialize M the variational parameter.", "created_at": "2022-06-01T12:53:39Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d384fee829d5daabd9461544c0335ecf2024a46", "message": "added the library reshape2 to visualize the matrix", "created_at": "2022-06-01T08:58:51Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3177a196064cff09b0acbe7e8216fdb8b98dbad6", "message": "Implemented the VEM for PLN PCA in VEM.r. Works fine but I don't have any initialization yet.", "created_at": "2022-06-01T08:57:51Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c83cf5dabc0586b1017e4c80a49a02d5ae593a0a", "message": "Added the function C_from_Sigma that takes Sigma and q and returns the q best eigenvectors of Sigma.\nI implemented the function how_much that takes Theta, the true theta, the fisher information  and gives the percentage of parameters that are inside the 95% interval.\nImplemented full_C_from_Sigma that returns the same as C_from_Sigma but complete the matrix C with zeros to have a squared matrix", "created_at": "2022-05-17T13:14:24Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a28d1f87696debb56b130a9c5a00d6502bebc0f2", "message": "Implemented the Sandwich estimator for Theta. Works fine (about 90% of the parameters inside the 95% confidence interval.", "created_at": "2022-05-17T13:07:53Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6bc03f32c5ca86765858369e5ead54c42df1d503", "message": "I removed everything that was not a function or a class so that we can import it outside the .r file", "created_at": "2022-05-17T13:06:41Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d9984108d0ad0fb1c6d8abc0d1b53ef71698014", "message": "minor changes on IMPS_PLN.r, and I began to get the matrices needed to compute C_n(\\ta) for the sandwich estimator. I added the function get_mat_i_Theta in VEM.r and the function get_Cn_Theta.", "created_at": "2022-05-16T07:34:51Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b356a0af08db9f9637dd06995b1c438ce4537614", "message": "Began to implement the sandwich estimator. The function torch_kron can't be computed for batch of matrices so I did a for loop.", "created_at": "2022-05-13T16:38:59Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbd430653c5e85a6e987952e24ac84e5050cbe5a", "message": "some files and their ground truth for comparison for confidence intervals", "created_at": "2022-05-10T10:18:23Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad8e2202d6eed6d7ed23e41aa6dd56af94c039be", "message": "Some useful functions such as sampling PLN variables, computing the log of a gaussian density, log stirling formula.", "created_at": "2022-05-10T10:17:29Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ba01a71baf7dc20b533e23c65fe7539a5b16588", "message": "Implement the VEM for PLN with a parametrisation centered in 0 and variance Sigma (PLN, not PLN-PCA). I did so since the calculus for teh sandwich estimator were done with this parametrisation.", "created_at": "2022-05-10T10:15:57Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04d2cb5bc453a65a3d201f0bb29d81f33f7d85bd", "message": "implement a gradient ascent on the log likelihood using importance sampling. I have basically copied the code from python using torch for R. I added the computation of the hessian of the log likelihood (vectorizing) with respect to beta to get confidence intervals. I do not do batch gradient ascent.", "created_at": "2022-05-10T10:13:52Z", "repo": "R_PLN", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "93fd7c3f062ed76b8049b6cf9ee36a96d5858573", "message": "Simple change.", "created_at": "2023-02-10T23:08:14Z", "repo": "pyUtils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39a22164d0a9e7d161aa7f7c86f99ad58d8ad4dd", "message": "removed the gitlab integration.", "created_at": "2023-02-10T23:05:03Z", "repo": "pyUtils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "adef54f38e9649ddbdd0e2d593be4db9665ef112", "message": "Added the CONTRIBUTING", "created_at": "2023-02-10T22:48:44Z", "repo": "pyUtils", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6cdbdcf3db783f1a98e3b7faac90067da0679be9", "message": "initial commit", "create